Manchester Reader/Writer
<UL>
<LI><b>G888</b> is an early attempt to draw the G888.</LI>
<LI><b>G888a</b> is an Eagle version of DEC's G888 with DIP versions of the 
MC1709.</LI>
<LI><b>G888b</b> an updated version of G888a.</LI>
<LI><b>G888c</b> an older version of G888a.</LI>
<LI><b>G888x</b> The latest verion of the G888, with a bunch of
cross-reference information in the schematic.</LI>
